sequenceDiagram
    actor Client
    participant Route as PUT /api/users/picture
    participant Auth as AuthenticationMiddleware
    participant Multer as Multer upload adapter
    participant Controller as SavePictureController
    participant UseCase as ChangeProfilePicture
    participant S3 as AwsS3FileStorage
    participant Repo as PgUserProfileRepository

    Client->>Route: PUT (Authorization: Bearer <jwt>, multipart picture)
    Route->>Auth: handle({ authorization })
    alt missing/invalid token
        Auth-->>Client: 401 + WWW-Authenticate: Bearer
    else valid token
        Auth->>Route: userId
        Route->>Multer: parse multipart file
        alt no file, another field name, over 5MB or malformed multipart
            Multer-->>Client: 400
        end
        Route->>Controller: handle({ file, userId })
        Controller->>Controller: validate(file required, mime type, max size, signature of the declared type)
        alt validation fails
            Controller-->>Client: 400 Validation Error
        else file valid
            Controller->>UseCase: execute({ userId, file })
            UseCase->>Repo: load({ id }) — name, current pictureKey
            alt user does not exist
                UseCase-->>Controller: UserNotFoundError (nothing uploaded)
                Controller-->>Client: 404
            end
            UseCase->>S3: upload({ file, key: userId_uuid.ext, contentType })
            note right of S3: no ACL — private bucket
            UseCase->>Repo: savePicture({ id, pictureKey, replacedPictureKey })
            note right of Repo: one short transaction — UPDATE … WHERE picture_key = replaced,<br/>INSERT outbox_events ProfilePictureReplaced
            alt save fails
                UseCase->>S3: delete({ the key just uploaded })
                UseCase-->>Controller: rethrows
                Controller-->>Client: 500
            else picture changed concurrently (0 rows updated)
                UseCase->>S3: delete({ the key just uploaded })
                UseCase-->>Controller: ConcurrentModificationError
                Controller-->>Client: 409
            else saved
                UseCase->>S3: getUrl({ key })
                S3-->>UseCase: CDN URL or pre-signed URL
                UseCase-->>Controller: { pictureUrl, initials }
            end
            Controller-->>Client: 200 { pictureUrl, initials }
        end
    end

    Note over Repo,S3: Later, after commit — outbox worker (ProcessOutboxEvents)<br/>claims ProfilePictureReplaced (FOR UPDATE SKIP LOCKED) → S3 delete(previous key) → mark processed
